# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Flint Preview, the GPU driving no display: a 131k window at f16/f16 with the experts of 45 of 47
# MoE layers in RAM (layers 0-1 are dense), ubatch 2048. Optimized by bench-optimize to stage 2
# (run flint-opt-speed): f16 costs four expert layers on the card against q8_0 and decodes 9-16 %
# faster from 65k on. The budget is Qwen3.6's, which meets docs/agent.md#context-budget at this window.
: "${MODEL:=flint}"
: "${CTX:=131072}"
: "${CPU_MOE:=47}"
: "${UB:=2048}"
: "${BUDGET:=16384}"
: "${MAX_TOKENS:=32000}"
: "${RESERVE_TOKENS:=32000}"
: "${KEEP_RECENT_TOKENS:=24000}"
